### Pay on collection
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "69aec52dc964f514c51ebd99",
      "name": "Mango Bubble Berry Tea",
      "url": "https://yourdomain.com/path/to/images/mango.png",
      "price": 4.50,
      "basePrice": 5.50,
      "quantity": 1,
      "type": "drinks",
      "category": "iced-tea",
      "options": {}
    }
  ],
  "total": 5.50,
  "customer": {
    "firstName": "Habeeb",
    "lastName": "Ola",
    "email": "example@email.com",
    "deliveryOption": "collection",
    "address": {}
  },
  "status": "pending",
  "paymentMethod": "collection",
  "stripeId": ""
}
### Stripe Payment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "69aec52dc964f514c51ebd99",
      "name": "Mango Bubble Berry Tea",
      "url": "https://yourdomain.com/path/to/images/mango.png",
      "price": 4.50,
      "basePrice": 5.50,
      "quantity": 1,
      "type": "drinks",
